{
  "category": "Discharge Pokémon",
  "entries": [
    {
      "text": "MANECTRIC is constantly discharging electricity from its mane. The sparks sometimes ignite forest fires. When it enters a battle, this POKéMON creates thunderclouds.",
      "version": "ruby"
    },
    {
      "text": "MANECTRIC discharges strong electricity from its mane. The mane is used for collecting electricity in the atmosphere. This POKéMON creates thunderclouds above its head.",
      "version": "sapphire"
    },
    {
      "text": "Because lightning falls in their vicinities, MANECTRIC were thought to have been born from lightning. In battle, they create thunderclouds.",
      "version": "emerald"
    },
    {
      "text": "It rarely appears before people. It is said to nest where lightning has fallen.",
      "version": "firered"
    },
    {
      "text": "It rarely appears before people. It is said to nest where lightning has fallen.",
      "version": "leafgreen"
    },
    {
      "text": "It discharges electricity from its mane. It creates a thundercloud overhead to drop lightning bolts.",
